  "resume": "This is a 22-minute video news report from Swiss TV (SF) documenting an FDP parliamentary group excursion to Heiden, Appenzell Ausserrhoden, on June 13, 2007. It includes statements by party members Felix Gutzwiller and Pascal Couchepin, as well as a visit to a dish factory. The report briefly touches on the rejection of the BVG pension reform in the Council of States."
